X:1
T:Dos Palomitas
O:Argentina
N:Two Little Pigeons. Melody from the mu-tech.org WorldTrad MIDI arrangement (Argentine folk song); chords from its printed lead sheet and accompaniment. Transposed from the source's A minor up a fourth to D minor for the recorder; the closing release bar (F2 z4) mirrors the tune's own section cadences so the loop restarts with a breath.
